Carrying out the interpretation and implementation of tourism policies on investments and finance;
Coordinating the process of profiling investment opportunities in the tourism sector;
Organizing stakeholder’s consultations on tourism investment and finance;
Coordinating development and review of frameworks for tourism partnerships and entrepreneurship;
Coordinating the implementation of tourism incentives and disincentives schemes;
Coordinating the formulation, review and implementation of special financing schemes for the tourism sector;
Coordinating capacity building through offering business and investment advisory services for tourism development;
Coordinating the promotion of programmes funded under Tourism Funds and other development partners;
Supervising the establishment and maintenance of database on tourism investments;
Monitoring and evaluation on the effectiveness of the implementation of tourism investment and finance policies, plans and strategies.
