Duties and Responsibilities:
This is an entry and training grade for this cadre. An officer at this level will work under the guidance of a senior officer. Specific duties and responsibilities include:-
Rescuing children from hostile environment;
Preparing and generating children welfare related reports;
Creating awareness and advocacy on Children Services;
Visiting homes to conduct interviews and compile reports for presentation to courts of law;
Identifying and committing Children to safe places;
Receiving and recording complaints and any other reports regarding violation of children rights; and
Collecting data on children welfare matters.
