Role overview:
We seek to recruit an experienced and self-motivated individual for the role of
Editor, Business & Technology
. Reporting to the Managing Editor, Content Hubs, the job holder will be responsible for the generation of content for business and technology, analysis, editorials, and ensuring that the stories are edited to comply with journalistic ethics, editorial objectives and set deadlines.
