Taking responsibility for the quality and quantity of the Business & Technology content across NMG Platforms;
Creating market-leading breaking and brand-defining business content;
Generating and pitching ideas that will enable the Business hub to meet its publishing targets and maximise audience impact;
Identifying gaps in coverage of business news to meet the needs of the audience;
Representing the NMG / brand angle in all business content created;
Assessing the climate and anticipating likely developments in business and technology for coverage;
Be an expert in the business world and maintain a wide and varied contacts book;
Representing the company as required, including (but not limited to) in media, in commercial conversations, in the market;
Commissioning valuable long-term business content that can be monetised;
Collaborating with the Editor, Social, Search & Analytics to package content in ways that optimise reach;
